        "label": "1st period",
        "score": "LA 1, BOS 0",
        "text": "Los Angeles needed nearly 14 minutes to get its first shot on goal, but Mats Zuccarello scored at 15:46, from Erik Gustafsson and Brandt Clarke, for his goal in a second straight game. Boston allowed the first goal for a third straight game."
      },
      {
        "label": "2nd period",
        "score": "LA 2, BOS 0",
        "text": "Michael DiPietro made a glove save on Quinton Byfield's penalty shot 5:56 in, awarded after Mason Lohrei hauled him down. Andre Lee made it 2–0 at 16:35, getting a piece of Scott Laughton's pass."
      },
      {
        "label": "3rd period",
        "score": "Final: LA 3, BOS 0",
        "text": "With a new top line of David Pastrnak, Elias Lindholm and Morgan Geekie, Boston pushed more, and Geekie got a penalty shot 9:51 in after Drew Doughty hauled him down, but Kuemper stopped his forehand wrister. Gustafsson hit the empty net with 3:07 left, assisted by Kuemper. Boston went 0-for-2 on the power play."
      }
